# LICENSES FOR HPC&A 3D SCIENCE KEYCHAINS SUITE

This repository contains both software code (Python CAD generators using Build123d) and 3D design assets (STL, STEP meshes, 3D printing batch plates, and renderings).

To balance openness with author rights and intellectual property protection, this project is licensed under a dual-licensing structure:

---

## 1. 3D Models, CAD Designs, Meshes & Documentation
### Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)

All 3D models (`.stl`, `.step`), batch print sheets, renderings (`.png`), drawings (`.svg`), and print manuals (`PRINT_SHOP_GUIDE.md`) are licensed under **CC BY-NC-SA 4.0**.

You are free to:
* **Share** — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format.
* **Adapt** — remix, transform, and build upon the material.

Under the following terms:
* **Attribution (BY)** — You must give appropriate credit to **Nima** and the **HPC&A Research Group**, provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made. You may do so in any reasonable manner, but not in any way that suggests the licensor endorses you or your use.
* **NonCommercial (NC)** — You may not use the material for commercial purposes. You may freely 3D-print for personal use, education, maker clubs, research gifts, or academic demonstrations. You may not sell the 3D-printed physical keychains or digital models for commercial profit without explicit prior written permission from Nima.
* **ShareAlike (SA)** — If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you must distribute your contributions under the same license as the original.
* **No additional restrictions** — You may not apply legal terms or technological measures that legally restrict others from doing anything the license permits.

For full license text, see: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode

